kart-track/1
id paddock
name The Paddock
about A club circuit in the hills: a long straight over a crest, a sweeping right-hander, an S, a chicane and a hairpin.
sky noon
scenery meadow
rain 0.15
half-width 7
verge 4
point 0 -90
point 0 -20 start
point 0 45
point -10 80
point -38 100
point -75 95
point -95 65
point -88 30
point -62 12
point -58 -14
point -82 -34
point -112 -42
point -132 -68
point -124 -104
point -92 -124
point -52 -128
point -18 -118
# Over the brow of a hill: 12 m up to 1.4 m, 6 m down; flat out a kart is
# half a second in the air (D-051).
crest 42 12 6 1.4
